flowchart LR
    editor[Editor prompt] -->|Sends intent| assistant[AI Assistant dock]
    assistant -->|Prompt and metadata| openRouter[OpenRouter]
    openRouter -->|Untrusted JSON| parser[Strict plan parser]
    parser -->|Typed plan| preview[Plan preview]
    preview -->|Apply| executor[Timeline executor]
    executor -->|Validated calls| timeline[TimelineModel]
    timeline -->|One transaction| undo[Undo and redo]
    parser -->|Reject| error[Actionable error]
    preview -->|Cancel| unchanged[Timeline unchanged]

